{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/indices/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/indices.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Indices — Laws & Practice","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-teal-700 text-white py-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-semibold\">Indices</div><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a></div></header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Laws of Indices</h2><div class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\">a^m × a^n = a^{m+n}, (a^m)^n = a^{mn}, a^{-n} = 1/a^n, a^{1/2} = √a.</div></section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Visual</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-700\">Powers grow/shrink rapidly; example: 2^0,2^1,2^2,...</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <svg width=\"360\" height=\"60\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <text x=\"10\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"12\">2^0=1</text>\n          <text x=\"60\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"12\">2^1=2</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"12\">2^2=4</text>\n          <text x=\"200\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"12\">2^3=8</text>\n          <text x=\"260\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"12\">2^4=16</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">1) (2^3)^2 = ?</div><input id=\"i1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 64\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"ic1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-teal-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"ih1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"ifb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">2) x^{-1/2} = ? (radical form)</div><input id=\"i2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1/√x\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"ic2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-teal-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"ih2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"ifb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"iQuiz\" class=\"bg-teal-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"iModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\"><div id=\"iContent\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"iClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div></div></div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-teal-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)} .mono{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}